    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58657" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολοβ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dock, curtail, mutilate</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				101
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.80.13
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς χεῖρας καὶ τοὺς πόδας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>2 Ki.</u>
					4.12
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be mutilated, imperfect</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arar.
				3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.6.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς γυναικὸς τὴν ῥῖνα κολοβοῦσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					1.78
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ φώκῃ κεκολοβωμένοι πόδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					487b23
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>GA</u>
				771a2
			</span></i>: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεκολοβῶσθαι τῶν ἐκτὸς μορίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>PA</u>
					695b2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of Time,
